WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.501
SPEAKER: Do you remember
when we used to walk down here

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:05.604
and all the neighbors
used to stare at us?

00:00:05.704 --> 00:00:06.639
And we used to be...

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.474
-And we would just be,
"Pumping."
-Runway.

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:11.844
SPEAKER: They would look at us
 like we were circus freaks,

00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:14.714
 but you can tell
 they enjoyed it.

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:18.117
SPEAKER 2: The minute
 I got off on 14th Street,

00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:20.286
 you could hear
the clickety-clack of the heels.

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:22.321
SPEAKER 3: The life,
 the light, the shadows.

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.557
KRISTEN LOVELL: They called
 14th Street "The Stroll,"

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:26.059
 and that was our turf.

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:29.928
SPEAKER 4:
 Some people choose sex work
 because they want to.

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:31.364
 Being a trans woman in the 80s,

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:33.800
a lot of us
did not have a choice.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.137
People were not hiring
people that looked like me.

00:00:38.237 --> 00:00:41.074
Trans life in general,
it was difficult.

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.276
I wanted to make people
understand the reality

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:45.612
of our lives
through storytelling.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:50.649
The one issue today that
obsesses New Yorkers. Crime.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.853
SPEAKER 5: The trannies
 were out on the street 24/7.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:56.489
 It was really
 a very bad situation.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.925
I mean, they think
I'm out here to murder people

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:01.194
instead of have sex with them
for money.

00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:04.197
SPEAKER 6:
 We didn't know who's who.
You know, everybody's a client.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:07.834
I actually gave fellatio
to a man who was a cop.

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:11.570
And after I was done doing
his deed, he arrested me.

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.307
Whether it was from
the police or the john,

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.208
there was a lot of violence.

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.745
I almost got killed by a john

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:21.114
 who dragged me
 for half a block in his car.

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:24.350
SPEAKER 7:
 We were on the front line with
 the gay and lesbian community

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.885
but you're not doing anything to
 help me from getting attacked.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:28.521
We knew we were freaks to them.

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:31.090
(SOBBING) I can't even
believe it, but it's, like,

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:32.225
 the things we had to do.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:36.529
SPEAKER 8:
 The trans community has been
 in survival mode forever.

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:41.201
 It's important that we all
 get an opportunity to...

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:43.336
thrive.

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.372
We've fought to be where we are.

00:01:46.472 --> 00:01:48.708
SPEAKER 9: The system
 never gave us resources.

00:01:49.408 --> 00:01:51.111
We created the resources.

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.213
We have always been last.

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.716
That's not gonna
happen anymore.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.286
SPEAKER 10: You owe it
 to every trans woman before you

00:02:00.686 --> 00:02:02.689
 and everyone after you
 to keep pushing.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.191
LOVELL: We were pushed out
 of the neighborhood years ago.

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:09.562
I was determined to make a film
 about The Stroll

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:10.897
 before we're gone.

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:14.267
SPEAKER 11:

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:17.069
-No.
-No, we're talkin'
about our lives.

00:02:17.169 --> 00:02:19.072
Out here before this
became this.

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:20.039
SPEAKER 11: I remember that.

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:21.808
-Ooh!
-(LAUGHTER)

00:02:21.908 --> 00:02:23.175
He said, "I remember that."

00:02:23.275 --> 00:02:24.644
I'm sure you do.

00:02:25.144 --> 00:02:26.145
What's your name.

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:27.246
(LAUGHTER)

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.349
SPEAKER 12: You still got it.

